399
00:13:26,460 --> 00:13:27,000
will be

400
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:28,440
super stabilized

401
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:29,360
because you've got

402
00:13:29,360 --> 00:13:30,180
super amounts

403
00:13:30,180 --> 00:13:30,980
of BCL2.

404
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:31,660
Now,

405
00:13:31,700 --> 00:13:32,220
that's not really

406
00:13:32,220 --> 00:13:32,800
a problem

407
00:13:32,800 --> 00:13:33,960
because the vast majority

408
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:34,480
of cells,

409
00:13:34,580 --> 00:13:35,300
and for the most part

410
00:13:35,300 --> 00:13:35,780
B cells,

411
00:13:36,180 --> 00:13:36,840
you don't want them

412
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:37,920
to apoptose anyway.

413
00:13:38,540 --> 00:13:39,020
However,

414
00:13:39,520 --> 00:13:40,980
there is one region

415
00:13:40,980 --> 00:13:41,820
in the body

416
00:13:41,820 --> 00:13:43,140
where you actually want

417
00:13:43,140 --> 00:13:44,620
a lot of apoptosis

418
00:13:44,620 --> 00:13:45,360
and that is

419
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:46,160
