420
00:13:46,580 --> 00:13:46,780
Now,

421
00:13:46,800 --> 00:13:47,540
why do you want that?

422
00:13:47,780 --> 00:13:48,400
Because remember,

423
00:13:48,520 --> 00:13:49,080
what's happening

424
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:49,780
in the follicle?

425
00:13:49,780 --> 00:13:50,860
In the follicle,

426
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:51,540
the B cells

427
00:13:51,540 --> 00:13:52,120
