440
00:14:10,380 --> 00:14:10,600
So,

441
00:14:10,820 --> 00:14:12,080
somatic hypermutation

442
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:12,800
is a

443
00:14:12,800 --> 00:14:15,520
desired state,

444
00:14:16,100 --> 00:14:17,440
