448
00:14:21,480 --> 00:14:22,740
you want those cells

449
00:14:22,740 --> 00:14:23,320
to die.

450
00:14:23,520 --> 00:14:24,320
That's the mechanism

451
00:14:24,320 --> 00:14:25,740
