452
00:14:25,860 --> 00:14:25,960
So,

453
00:14:26,160 --> 00:14:27,800
we could state it otherwise.

454
00:14:28,460 --> 00:14:29,440
When B cells,

455
00:14:30,060 --> 00:14:31,320
B cells are born

456
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:32,120
in the bone marrow

457
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:33,280
and they're born

458
00:14:33,280 --> 00:14:34,340
as naive B cells

459
00:14:34,340 --> 00:14:35,020
and then they go

460
00:14:35,020 --> 00:14:35,620
to college.

461
00:14:36,080 --> 00:14:36,680
And where do they

462
00:14:36,680 --> 00:14:37,300
go to college?

463
00:14:37,440 --> 00:14:38,120
They go to college

464
00:14:38,120 --> 00:14:38,900
in the lymph node.

465
00:14:39,540 --> 00:14:39,820
And,

466
00:14:40,160 --> 00:14:42,080
in the lymph node,

467
00:14:42,540 --> 00:14:43,120
when they go

468
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:43,780
to college,

469
00:14:43,980 --> 00:14:46,040
the way by which

470
00:14:46,040 --> 00:14:48,160
they fail in college

471
00:14:48,160 --> 00:14:49,300
is somatic,

472
00:14:49,460 --> 00:14:51,460
the test in college

473
00:14:51,460 --> 00:14:52,700
is somatic hypermutation.

474
00:14:52,880 --> 00:14:53,420
Are you able

475
00:14:53,420 --> 00:14:54,080
to produce

476
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:56,220
a newly mutated

477
00:14:56,220 --> 00:14:57,340
immunoglobulin

478
00:14:57,340 --> 00:14:58,140
that might be able

479
00:14:58,140 --> 00:14:59,380
to react against

480
00:14:59,380 --> 00:14:59,980
antigen?

481
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:01,880
And if you're not

482
00:15:01,880 --> 00:15:02,780
able to do that,

483
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:04,000
then you have to fail.

484
00:15:04,340 --> 00:15:05,260
And the way by which

485
00:15:05,260 --> 00:15:07,120
the lymph node fails

486
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:07,760
the B cell

487
00:15:07,760 --> 00:15:08,560
and removes it

488
00:15:08,560 --> 00:15:09,700
is apoptosis.

489
00:15:10,120 --> 00:15:10,360
So,

490
00:15:10,420 --> 00:15:11,020
if the B cell

491
00:15:11,020 --> 00:15:11,840
is not able

492
00:15:11,840 --> 00:15:13,180
