500
00:15:21,740 --> 00:15:21,880
Okay?

501
00:15:22,300 --> 00:15:22,620
And so,

502
00:15:22,700 --> 00:15:23,600
one of the key features

503
00:15:23,600 --> 00:15:24,700
of follicular lymphoma

504
00:15:24,700 --> 00:15:25,660
is that the cells

505
00:15:25,660 --> 00:15:26,620
