00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:33,300
BCL2.

512
00:15:33,420 --> 00:15:33,600
And so,

513
00:15:33,640 --> 00:15:34,360
the cells can't

514
00:15:34,360 --> 00:15:34,960
apoptose

515
00:15:34,960 --> 00:15:36,440
because the mitochondrial

516
00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:37,300
membrane is super

517
00:15:37,300 --> 00:15:37,840
stabilized.

518
00:15:38,540 --> 00:15:38,740
So,

519
00:15:38,820 --> 00:15:40,400
that's BCL2

520
00:15:40,400 --> 00:15:41,280
and its relationship

521
00:15:41,280 --> 00:15:42,620
to follicular lymphoma.

522
00:15:43,980 --> 00:15:44,880
A few other

523
00:15:44,880 --> 00:15:45,880
important features

524
00:15:45,880 --> 00:15:46,640
concerning tuber

525
00:15:46,640 --> 00:15:47,060
development.

526
00:15:47,280 --> 00:15:48,120
We've sort of

527
00:15:48,120 --> 00:15:49,660
concluded our

528
00:15:49,660 --> 00:15:50,260
discussion of the

529
00:15:50,260 --> 00:15:50,800
key regulatory

530
00:15:50,800 --> 00:15:51,340
systems,

531
00:15:51,500 --> 00:15:52,180
but there are a

