00:15:52,180 --> 00:15:52,860
few other features

533
00:15:52,860 --> 00:15:53,720
to be familiar with.

534
00:15:53,800 --> 00:15:54,360
First of all,

535
00:15:55,100 --> 00:15:56,020
telomerase

536
00:15:56,020 --> 00:15:58,220
is a necessary

537
00:15:58,220 --> 00:16:02,120
enzyme

538
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:03,280
for cell

539
00:16:03,280 --> 00:16:04,180
immortality.

540
00:16:04,540 --> 00:16:04,720
Now,

541
00:16:04,780 --> 00:16:05,280
let's go back

542
00:16:05,280 --> 00:16:06,020
and remind ourselves.

543
00:16:06,160 --> 00:16:06,660
First of all,

544
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:07,420
cells,

545
00:16:07,540 --> 00:16:08,440
when they divide

546
00:16:08,440 --> 00:16:09,100
normally,

547
00:16:09,640 --> 00:16:10,620
each time a cell

548
00:16:10,620 --> 00:16:11,240
divides,

549
00:16:11,600 --> 00:16:12,340
its telomere

550
00:16:12,340 --> 00:16:12,800
