551
00:16:13,180 --> 00:16:14,980
And telomeres

552
00:16:14,980 --> 00:16:15,300
are at the

553
00:16:15,300 --> 00:16:15,980
very end of

554
00:16:15,980 --> 00:16:16,680
the DNA

555
00:16:16,680 --> 00:16:18,360
of each

556
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:18,900
