557
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:20,080
and the telomeres

558
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:20,720
shorten,

559
00:16:20,880 --> 00:16:21,420
and every time

560
00:16:21,420 --> 00:16:21,920
they shorten,

561
00:16:22,420 --> 00:16:23,640
eventually that

562
00:16:23,640 --> 00:16:24,460
results in

563
00:16:24,460 --> 00:16:25,380
