564
00:16:25,580 --> 00:16:25,740
So,

565
00:16:25,800 --> 00:16:26,520
the continuous

566
00:16:26,520 --> 00:16:27,160
shortening of

567
00:16:27,160 --> 00:16:27,840
the telomeres

568
00:16:27,840 --> 00:16:29,060
with serial cell

569
00:16:29,060 --> 00:16:29,880
divisions results

570
00:16:29,880 --> 00:16:30,560
